  "description": "Clean Architecture template — Dapper Abstractions (Application ports): IDbSession (ambient unit-of-work with a Dapper-style execution facade so handlers never reference the Dapper NuGet), IDbSessionAccessor, IDbConnectionFactory, ISqlDialect, plus the DbProvider and SortDirection enums. Contract-only, ZERO dependency (BCL only) — pair it with SU2.C15e.Infrastructure.Persistence.Dapper for the runtime. Split out of SU2.C15e.UseCases in 2.0.0; namespace renamed from SU2.C15e.UseCases.Data.Dapper — see docs/template-packaging/migration-2.0.0-infrastructure-persistence-split.md. Numeronym `C15e` = CleanArchitecture. Generation 2026 series.",
